            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_exskill_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "超無敵鉄甲「虎丸」、前進\n……名前、恥ずかしいですね",
            "LocalizeEN": "\"Super Invincible Steel Toramaru\", charging forward... the name's a little embarrassing."
