            "LocalizeEN": "I guess I have to."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Growup_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_growup_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "サボらせて、くれなさそうですね……仕方ありません",
            "LocalizeEN": "I don't suppose you'll let me slack this once off. Alright, fine."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "What is it? Did I caught your interest?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "Whoa, you would do this for me?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_growup_4",
            "LocalizeJP": "ありがとうございます……なんですか、普通にお礼くらい言いますが",
            "LocalizeEN": "Thank you very much... What is it? It's not like I can't say thank you."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Relationship_Up_1",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_relationship_up_1",
            "LocalizeJP": "ふふっ……まあ、波長が合わないわけではなさそうですね",
            "LocalizeEN": "Hehe. Well, it seems like we are on the same wavelength after all."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Relationship_Up_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_relationship_up_2",
            "LocalizeJP": "まぁ、頼られるのは嫌な気分ではありませんが……",
            "LocalizeEN": "I mean, it's not like I hate being relied on..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Relationship_Up_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_relationship_up_3",
            "LocalizeJP": "そういう積極的なアプローチは、ちょっと……",
            "LocalizeEN": "When you approach me that way, it's a little..."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 20016,
            "DialogCategory": "Relationship",
            "VoiceClip": "Iroha_Relationship_Up_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0156/ch0156_relationship_up_4",
            "LocalizeJP": "心が通うとは、こういうことなのでしょうか",
            "LocalizeEN": "Is this what is like to understand one another?"
        }
